  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Office of the Auditor General of Somalia Peer Support 2021-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support through Intosai/IDI to strengthen the Auditor General&#x2019;s Office (OAG) in Somalia.  The cooperation will focus on the goals in the Auditor General&#x2019;s strategic plan; high quality audit reports, Internal governance, external communication, HR management, infrastructure and ICT capacity and amending the legal framework for the OAGS.</narrative>
  </description>
